WEBVTT

01:40.930 --> 01:45.700
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.400 --> 01:50.840
[Episode 14]

02:42.620 --> 02:44.940
You let the leech demon escape.

02:45.310 --> 02:46.610
You deserve death!

02:52.120 --> 02:53.090
Who are you?

02:53.260 --> 02:55.190
Why did you slaughter the village?

03:00.500 --> 03:01.710
Looks like

03:01.710 --> 03:03.430
you're that busybody.

03:04.430 --> 03:07.240
I'm Ye Yuan, the Right Guardian of Sky City.

03:07.360 --> 03:09.310
Where is that leech demon?

03:09.370 --> 03:10.490
I don't know.

03:14.240 --> 03:14.770
Let's go.

03:22.210 --> 03:23.740
You showed up yourself.

03:24.000 --> 03:24.900
Perfect.

03:25.579 --> 03:26.940
Focus on your core.

03:27.280 --> 03:28.550
Guide your qi through Chonglou,

03:28.550 --> 03:30.750
then through Jianggong to Mingtang.

03:32.910 --> 03:33.710
Who's there?

03:34.010 --> 03:36.140
Young man, just do as I say.

03:36.170 --> 03:37.460
Who's there?

03:42.750 --> 03:45.150
You can see
his demonic aura now, can't you?

04:06.520 --> 04:07.930
It's you guys.

04:08.110 --> 04:09.240
Who else could it be?

04:13.320 --> 04:15.580
Zui, don't pursue a desperate enemy.

04:15.790 --> 04:17.120
He's not our priority anyway.

04:17.120 --> 04:18.000
He got off easy.

04:23.640 --> 04:25.070
He's the one from my dream

04:25.430 --> 04:27.690
who gouged out his own Clairvoyance Eye.

04:33.300 --> 04:34.620
Young man,

04:34.950 --> 04:36.800
you have
a Clairvoyance Eye on your forehead.

04:36.800 --> 04:37.800
Are you…

04:38.070 --> 04:39.560
a descendant of the Yang family?

04:39.560 --> 04:40.890
Miss, you're mistaken.

04:41.000 --> 04:43.320
I'm Mu Mie. I'm not from the Yang family.

04:43.580 --> 04:44.640
Your surname is Mu?

04:44.790 --> 04:46.320
What is your father's name?

04:47.000 --> 04:48.510
My late father was Mu Renzhi.

04:48.510 --> 04:49.950
He was the fifth child in the family,

04:49.950 --> 04:51.680
so people called him Mu Xiaowu.

04:54.500 --> 04:55.830
Then, is your mother's name

04:55.830 --> 04:56.870
Yang Yan?

05:01.160 --> 05:02.490
You know my late mother?

05:04.720 --> 05:05.930
What?

05:06.190 --> 05:07.190
Your late mother?

05:08.170 --> 05:09.570
What happened to my aunt?

05:16.800 --> 05:18.980
So you're from 20 years ago.

05:19.160 --> 05:20.540
Unfortunately,

05:21.520 --> 05:23.580
my mother passed away six months ago.

05:24.780 --> 05:27.550
I didn't expect you to be so talented

05:27.850 --> 05:29.580
and have Clairvoyance as well.

05:29.760 --> 05:31.300
Did you learn it from your mother?

05:31.300 --> 05:32.090
No.

05:33.170 --> 05:34.680
When I was little,

05:34.810 --> 05:37.100
I learned it from a masked guy.

05:39.159 --> 05:40.240
A masked guy?

05:41.360 --> 05:42.730
Could it have been me?

05:43.190 --> 05:44.850
That masked guy,

05:45.070 --> 05:46.730
did he tell you anything else?

05:46.940 --> 05:49.800
After teaching me
to awaken Clairvoyance, he left.

05:50.700 --> 05:52.930
Cousin, do you know him?

05:55.000 --> 05:55.750
I don't.

05:57.680 --> 05:58.280
Oh, right.

05:58.840 --> 06:00.700
Why did you come to Baiyu Village?

06:00.800 --> 06:01.650
I came to...

06:07.980 --> 06:10.070
Better not tell him for now.

06:10.240 --> 06:12.870
I'm here to attend to something.

06:13.010 --> 06:14.750
But by the time I arrived,

06:15.270 --> 06:17.270
Chief and the others had already...

06:23.280 --> 06:24.780
Miss Cuiyu Mingluan.

06:25.070 --> 06:25.800
Please wait.

06:29.430 --> 06:30.800
How do you know my name?

06:44.600 --> 06:47.040
I need to go patrol the city now.

06:49.430 --> 06:51.360
I know you're pretending to sleep.

06:56.040 --> 06:58.050
Keep a close eye on my canary.

06:58.190 --> 06:59.680
If anything happens to him,

06:59.680 --> 07:01.280
you'll have to answer for it.

07:01.390 --> 07:02.040
Yes.

07:06.270 --> 07:09.200
What a good opportunity
to explore the Rebirth Pool.

07:26.020 --> 07:27.860
Do you smell anything?

07:28.460 --> 07:29.600
I don't know.

07:30.270 --> 07:32.630
My legs feel weak now,

07:32.650 --> 07:34.450
and my vision's getting blurry.

07:35.580 --> 07:36.810
Me too.

07:59.870 --> 08:01.410
The demonic aura is overwhelming.

08:01.410 --> 08:03.510
What a powerful magical artifact.

08:04.220 --> 08:07.120
But… something is missing.

08:09.520 --> 08:11.150
Above the water,

08:11.620 --> 08:13.280
there seems to be a formation.

08:14.340 --> 08:15.830
Judging from its energy,

08:16.900 --> 08:18.830
it has a purifying effect.

08:19.060 --> 08:21.520
Who dares to trespass into the Rebirth Pool?

08:25.690 --> 08:27.000
It's you?

08:27.270 --> 08:30.840
Any trespasser must die.

08:33.159 --> 08:34.500
Don't you dare hurt him.

08:44.970 --> 08:46.920
So this is the Golden Dawn.

08:47.830 --> 08:51.340
Left Guardian,
you indeed have an affair with him.

08:52.320 --> 08:53.720
It's none of your business.

08:53.720 --> 08:56.440
He must die today.

08:56.500 --> 08:59.940
You're just as guilty for protecting him.

09:00.910 --> 09:02.000
Ye Yuan,

09:02.590 --> 09:04.110
you're speaking too soon.

09:17.000 --> 09:18.970
Jia Lan's power to control demons

09:19.080 --> 09:20.890
is truly impressive.

09:21.390 --> 09:22.530
Tell me,

09:22.690 --> 09:26.070
what exactly is wrong with the Rebirth Pool?

09:30.940 --> 09:32.860
The Seven-Star Alignment

09:33.950 --> 09:35.950
is about to end.

09:36.110 --> 09:38.440
I must find the leech demon

09:38.590 --> 09:40.200
before time runs out.

09:40.230 --> 09:43.940
She has the last fragment
of the Golden Dawn inside her.

09:44.150 --> 09:45.720
But the leech demon

09:46.340 --> 09:49.370
was taken away by that three-eyed guy

09:49.480 --> 09:50.650
from 20 years ago.

09:51.820 --> 09:55.250
What does Lord Jiuhuo
intend to do with the Golden Dawn?

09:56.050 --> 10:00.450
The Golden Dawn
is the most powerful magical artifact of the Netherworld Clan.

10:01.010 --> 10:02.490
Once it's repaired,

10:02.550 --> 10:06.410
Lord Jiuhuo can use it
to break the Boundary and release the Black Fox.

10:08.500 --> 10:11.170
Everything is normal at the Rebirth Pool today.

10:11.660 --> 10:13.830
You haven't seen Wangquan Hongye,

10:14.080 --> 10:15.480
nor have you seen me.

10:30.840 --> 10:32.240
I can't shake the feeling

10:32.490 --> 10:34.390
that something just happened.

10:44.540 --> 10:48.560
[Six-Winged Golden Bird]
[One-eyed Lion King] [Cuiyu Mingluan]

10:46.240 --> 10:47.720
Many names of the great demons

10:47.720 --> 10:49.670
on this booklet have been crossed out—

10:49.670 --> 10:51.630
yours included.

10:52.550 --> 10:55.750
They say you escaped from the breeding ground.

10:55.840 --> 10:57.440
What is that place?

10:58.120 --> 10:59.580
What secrets does it hold?

11:01.030 --> 11:02.560
I don't remember anything.

11:04.790 --> 11:05.910
I can't help you.

11:07.960 --> 11:09.140
Miss Cuiyu,

11:09.720 --> 11:10.480
why…

11:11.240 --> 11:13.550
why did you kill those people in Baiyu Village?

11:13.550 --> 11:15.480
I really don't remember anything.

11:18.200 --> 11:19.350
Sky City

11:19.370 --> 11:21.450
must be hiding countless secrets,

11:22.440 --> 11:25.450
and you are the key to uncovering these secrets.

11:25.640 --> 11:28.380
So please think carefully again.

11:29.150 --> 11:30.900
Just because you visited Baiyu Village,

11:30.900 --> 11:33.190
Ye Yuan massacred the entire village.

11:33.570 --> 11:34.900
So this secret

11:35.280 --> 11:37.210
must be very important to Sky City.

11:38.680 --> 11:39.810
All I know is

11:40.650 --> 11:42.290
Sky City is very dangerous.

11:44.140 --> 11:46.340
I really can't remember anything else.

11:52.810 --> 11:55.530
Miss Cuiyu, I know hypnosis.

11:55.720 --> 11:57.850
I can enter your mind and see your past.

11:59.000 --> 12:00.030
If you don't mind—

12:00.030 --> 12:00.790
I do mind.

12:03.480 --> 12:05.480
I don't want to know about that past.

12:06.030 --> 12:07.680
You're being hunted by people from Sky City,

12:07.680 --> 12:09.680
and it's chaos everywhere outside.

12:09.970 --> 12:11.440
Only by staying with us

12:11.630 --> 12:13.000
can you be safe.

12:14.620 --> 12:16.480
You can barely protect yourself.

12:17.270 --> 12:19.100
How can you guarantee my safety?

12:23.580 --> 12:25.780
What… do you mean?

12:31.500 --> 12:35.320
This young man's injuries
are severe, both internally and externally.

12:35.320 --> 12:37.230
He's also drained too much power.

12:37.320 --> 12:39.980
He won't be able to use Clairvoyance for a while.

12:50.080 --> 12:51.340
Miss Cuiyu.

12:51.920 --> 12:55.550
I've heard that
leech demons are all excellent healers.

12:55.790 --> 12:58.390
Can you prescribe
something to help my cousin?

13:00.320 --> 13:02.120
I didn't bring any pills with me.

13:06.970 --> 13:10.020
Rejecting Dummy so coldly
will break his heart.

13:10.670 --> 13:11.510
Besides,

13:12.030 --> 13:14.020
after we heal this Yang fellow,

13:14.180 --> 13:16.420
he'll be able to protect us.

13:18.790 --> 13:19.510
Fine.

13:20.200 --> 13:22.240
Since you saved my life,

13:22.360 --> 13:24.220
I can prescribe medicine for you.

13:24.320 --> 13:25.720
But on one condition:

13:27.000 --> 13:28.360
he has to assist me.

13:35.670 --> 13:37.440
You've got some nerve

13:38.440 --> 13:40.240
sneaking into the Rebirth Pool.

13:42.270 --> 13:44.400
Actually, you knew I was faking sleep,

13:44.770 --> 13:47.560
so naturally, you expected me to act.

13:48.210 --> 13:49.830
The mandala flower on my neck

13:49.900 --> 13:51.430
should be able to locate me.

13:51.810 --> 13:53.740
So you'd have come sooner or later.

13:54.480 --> 13:56.960
You knew I'd rescue you?

13:57.110 --> 13:58.310
I knew

13:58.650 --> 14:00.020
you were testing me,

14:00.240 --> 14:02.330
testing how bold I am

14:02.600 --> 14:04.530
and whether I have any value to you.

14:04.890 --> 14:05.940
Value?

14:07.270 --> 14:08.670
You're quite something,

14:09.200 --> 14:13.060
using the aphrodisiac incense so skillfully.

14:13.770 --> 14:15.760
What exactly are you scheming?

14:16.560 --> 14:17.540
As you've seen,

14:17.960 --> 14:19.490
that huge magical artifact

14:19.770 --> 14:21.640
is used to rescue Jia Lan.

14:22.390 --> 14:23.920
And once Jia Lan is rescued,

14:23.980 --> 14:25.110
you, Left Guardian,

14:25.650 --> 14:27.250
will cease to exist.

14:27.630 --> 14:29.710
There are eyes everywhere in Sky City.

14:29.710 --> 14:31.960
Even though you've altered Ye Yuan's memory,

14:31.960 --> 14:34.260
the fact that
you've been keeping me by your side

14:34.260 --> 14:36.060
will eventually be discovered.

14:36.830 --> 14:38.440
Instead of being on the defensive,

14:38.440 --> 14:40.160
we'd better take the offensive.

14:40.160 --> 14:41.850
Bring me to Jiuhuo.

14:42.400 --> 14:45.020
Let's put on a show together.

15:00.320 --> 15:02.810
Wangquan Hongye?

15:03.010 --> 15:05.780
Shouldn't he be at Mount Xuankong?

15:06.080 --> 15:08.420
I wanted to keep him around as a plaything,

15:08.870 --> 15:11.590
so I took the liberty of bringing him out.

15:11.720 --> 15:13.620
Then how did he wake up?

15:14.720 --> 15:17.360
Lord Jiuhuo, you've
stumped me with that question.

15:17.360 --> 15:20.390
I don't know how he woke up either.

15:21.200 --> 15:22.260
It doesn't matter.

15:22.430 --> 15:24.120
I'd like to see

15:24.920 --> 15:27.660
if it's really so hard to kill him.

15:30.160 --> 15:31.640
Left Guardian!

15:33.650 --> 15:34.870
Lord Jiuhuo,

15:34.980 --> 15:37.570
he can't die now.

15:39.390 --> 15:40.640
Why?

15:41.600 --> 15:42.930
Have you fallen for him?

15:53.310 --> 15:55.640
A plaything is just a plaything,

15:55.750 --> 15:58.550
but we must make full use of him.

16:05.390 --> 16:09.240
I heard that the leech demon
the Right Guardian was chasing

16:09.260 --> 16:11.710
was taken by that three-eyed human.

16:12.440 --> 16:14.280
There's no need to look for them.

16:14.550 --> 16:17.380
If we use Wangquan Hongye's life as bait,

16:17.670 --> 16:19.270
he'll definitely come to us.

16:21.960 --> 16:23.690
Left Guardian, by doing this,

16:23.750 --> 16:28.000
are you truly trying to solve my problems?

16:29.590 --> 16:32.550
Naturally, I'm being a bit selfish here.

16:32.690 --> 16:33.730
Go on.

16:33.790 --> 16:37.120
Lord Jiuhuo, you'll soon
have Jia Lan by your side.

16:37.230 --> 16:39.530
So if I want to keep him to entertain me,

16:39.630 --> 16:41.760
it shouldn't be too much to ask, right?

16:58.040 --> 17:00.100
There are countless men in the world.

17:00.170 --> 17:02.540
Why favor this

17:04.230 --> 17:05.920
particular human?

17:10.000 --> 17:12.510
He's clever and interesting.

17:13.240 --> 17:14.829
Like a tiger with teeth.

17:16.569 --> 17:18.480
Keeping him by my side,

17:18.589 --> 17:21.440
I'll personally pull out each of his teeth.

17:21.490 --> 17:25.050
Once I've used him up, I'll kill him again.

17:26.160 --> 17:28.940
Isn't that entertaining?

17:32.590 --> 17:33.240
Fine.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.400
I'll trust you this once.

17:35.800 --> 17:37.480
You have three days.

17:37.510 --> 17:39.480
Use Wangquan Hongye as bait

17:39.750 --> 17:42.690
to lure out those restless little pests.

17:54.080 --> 17:55.850
Spread the word across the city:

17:55.850 --> 17:57.330
within three days,

17:57.360 --> 18:00.060
if I can't see
the leech demon Cuiyu Mingluan,

18:00.080 --> 18:02.740
I'll execute Wangquan Hongye.

18:31.470 --> 18:34.900
Sir, what are you doing?

18:36.110 --> 18:37.710
Aren't you afraid of the sun?

18:37.990 --> 18:39.320
I'll shield you from it.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.820
I'm not…

18:41.790 --> 18:42.590
Thank you.

18:44.790 --> 18:47.720
You're really
saying one thing and meaning another.

18:53.710 --> 18:55.430
Come on, say something.

18:55.460 --> 18:58.190
Are you planning
to be this awkward the whole way?

19:00.500 --> 19:03.070
Sir, um...

19:03.540 --> 19:04.950
why did you help me?

19:06.290 --> 19:07.940
I don't even know

19:08.330 --> 19:10.870
if I actually killed someone or not.

19:10.900 --> 19:12.500
My intuition tells me

19:12.880 --> 19:15.410
you're not a demon
who'd kill without reason.

19:15.890 --> 19:18.050
You... you'd trust a demon?

19:18.550 --> 19:21.430
Both humans and demons
have good and bad in them.

19:21.880 --> 19:23.080
Why distrust demons?

19:39.710 --> 19:40.540
Miss,

19:41.020 --> 19:42.010
what's wrong?

19:43.720 --> 19:46.230
I... I want to say…

19:47.410 --> 19:50.930
you're the first human to trust me and save me.

19:53.240 --> 19:55.440
What did you just say?

19:57.800 --> 19:59.360
I want to say thank you.

20:01.720 --> 20:02.510
Mr. Mu,

20:03.240 --> 20:03.920
do you…

20:05.110 --> 20:06.240
want to learn

20:06.240 --> 20:09.100
the Leech Clan's
secret blood exchange technique?

20:09.270 --> 20:11.270
I don't quite understand it myself,

20:11.440 --> 20:13.350
but they say after learning it,

20:13.440 --> 20:16.570
you can master unparalleled martial arts,

20:16.750 --> 20:19.010
bring honor to your family, and all that.

20:23.410 --> 20:24.630
Sorry.

20:25.200 --> 20:27.820
I forgot your parents had passed away.

20:29.400 --> 20:31.730
If you're bad with words, just stay quiet!

20:38.440 --> 20:40.050
Do you want to learn it or not?

20:40.160 --> 20:41.280
I heard

20:41.590 --> 20:43.320
you can practice it with a girl.

20:46.160 --> 20:47.240
I'm talking to you.

21:01.710 --> 21:03.910
Miss, there's honeysuckle here.

21:08.360 --> 21:10.060
He's really a dummy.

21:26.200 --> 21:27.370
It's for me?

21:28.270 --> 21:29.300
Yes.

21:29.900 --> 21:31.890
I think this bunch of flowers
is very beautiful,

21:31.890 --> 21:33.420
so I'm giving it to you both.

21:37.070 --> 21:38.750
How do you know

21:39.530 --> 21:40.820
there are two of us?

21:41.280 --> 21:43.110
Your eye colors are different.

21:43.630 --> 21:45.680
The girl
who guided me here earlier had blue eyes,

21:45.680 --> 21:46.880
and you have red ones.

21:47.880 --> 21:50.580
Just eye colors are different?

21:50.750 --> 21:52.180
Your personalities are different too.

21:52.180 --> 21:56.460
Miss Cuiyu with blue eyes is gentle and kind,

21:57.110 --> 22:00.400
while you… are fiery and straightforward.

22:01.810 --> 22:03.820
Then who do you prefer?

22:04.590 --> 22:06.550
Me or her?

22:11.660 --> 22:13.420
I was just joking.

22:13.570 --> 22:15.310
Do you really need to avoid me like this?

22:15.310 --> 22:16.440
Am I that unlikable?

22:17.960 --> 22:19.000
Besides,

22:19.620 --> 22:21.580
being only gentle and kind

22:21.790 --> 22:24.350
is not enough to survive in this world.

22:25.400 --> 22:26.500
Don't get me wrong.

22:26.970 --> 22:28.650
Both of you are very nice.

22:29.070 --> 22:31.000
So, no matter which one of you it is,

22:31.310 --> 22:33.310
I don't believe you killed someone.

22:34.440 --> 22:35.090
Miss,

22:35.800 --> 22:38.050
can you tell me what exactly happened?

22:39.430 --> 22:41.010
So you're trying to trick me into talking.

22:41.010 --> 22:42.510
Don't push your luck just because

22:42.510 --> 22:44.210
I've been nice to you.

22:44.530 --> 22:46.160
Miss, that's not what I mean.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.620
I just think

22:51.180 --> 22:52.400
you might want to know

22:52.400 --> 22:53.590
the truth as well.

22:54.820 --> 22:57.090
Demons kill by nature.

22:57.430 --> 23:00.270
Do you think I should care about the truth?

23:00.310 --> 23:01.370
It's not like that.

23:01.770 --> 23:03.960
In my eyes, humans and demons are the same.

23:03.960 --> 23:04.880
Dummy,

23:05.600 --> 23:07.510
don't think your theory about right and wrong

23:07.510 --> 23:09.000
regardless of human or demon

23:09.000 --> 23:10.130
is enough to sway me.

23:10.640 --> 23:11.920
But there's one thing…

23:13.200 --> 23:14.250
Say one more word,

23:15.680 --> 23:17.590
and I'll really get angry.

23:24.160 --> 23:24.920
Sorry.

23:26.540 --> 23:27.710
I overstepped.

23:31.700 --> 23:33.980
We've picked enough. Let's head back.

24:03.470 --> 24:05.460
You're not afraid at all, are you?

24:07.420 --> 24:10.070
Why are you ignoring me?

24:11.660 --> 24:13.290
Your Lord Jiuhuo said

24:13.320 --> 24:15.120
I'd be safe for these three days.

24:16.710 --> 24:19.860
But I can continue to torment you, can't I?

24:21.010 --> 24:23.390
I've seen a sunset like this once before.

24:24.960 --> 24:26.010
Just like today.

24:27.340 --> 24:29.360
With your Dongfang Huaizhu?

24:30.120 --> 24:31.930
The sun set quickly that day.

24:32.920 --> 24:35.220
I'm not interested in your story.

24:36.250 --> 24:38.050
Then just watch with me for a bit.

24:38.420 --> 24:39.590
Consider it

24:40.730 --> 24:42.790
a reward for completing the task.

25:09.880 --> 25:12.260
One of you wants me as a vessel for Jia Lan.

25:12.500 --> 25:14.700
The other wants Dongfang Huaizhu back.

25:15.040 --> 25:16.740
Both of you are dreaming.

25:17.320 --> 25:18.630
I'm only myself.

25:19.620 --> 25:22.430
Using Wangquan Hongye to deal with Jiuhuo

25:22.640 --> 25:24.310
is not a bad idea.

25:31.440 --> 25:32.350
These pills

25:32.430 --> 25:35.070
can help you
quickly recover your powers within three days.

25:35.070 --> 25:36.790
Then you can use Clairvoyance again.

25:36.790 --> 25:38.050
Thank you, Miss Cuiyu.

25:38.110 --> 25:39.550
But after I recover,

25:40.350 --> 25:42.210
will you still insist on leaving?

25:43.510 --> 25:46.770
Actually, there's something
I've been wanting to ask you.

25:49.070 --> 25:49.640
Go ahead.

25:50.750 --> 25:53.750
Did you exhaust your spiritual power

25:54.110 --> 25:56.110
to use Clairvoyance a few days ago?

25:56.400 --> 25:57.070
Yes.

25:57.680 --> 25:59.160
Then do you know

25:59.530 --> 26:02.180
exhausting your spiritual and mental power

26:02.790 --> 26:04.160
could cost you…

26:05.160 --> 26:06.920
at least 10 years of your life?

26:07.270 --> 26:08.000
I know.

26:08.710 --> 26:11.180
And you still did it? Why?

26:15.330 --> 26:17.270
At that time, Zui was in danger.

26:18.890 --> 26:20.400
If I hadn't done it,

26:22.270 --> 26:23.680
I might have lost her.

26:24.240 --> 26:25.970
You can't clot blood properly.

26:26.000 --> 26:27.570
If that wound had been any worse,

26:27.570 --> 26:28.970
you'd have died for sure.

26:29.680 --> 26:30.550
Between my life

26:31.510 --> 26:32.450
and Zui's,

26:31.710 --> 26:33.920
♪ Moonlight paints the ground silver white ♪

26:33.270 --> 26:34.510
I choose hers

26:34.830 --> 26:37.000
♪ Yet some stubborn soul holds it tight ♪

26:36.480 --> 26:37.680
without hesitation.

26:37.920 --> 26:38.750
Why?

26:38.460 --> 26:40.640
♪ Mistaking it for the deepest sorrow ♪

26:39.710 --> 26:41.630
You humans live short lives.

26:41.570 --> 26:42.980
♪ That never fades ♪

26:42.630 --> 26:44.950
Why would you value someone else's life

26:44.840 --> 26:47.240
♪ Barren or bright, it's just the sea of the heart ♪

26:44.990 --> 26:46.430
more than your own?

26:48.380 --> 26:52.080
♪ Love fades and blooms and starts again ♪

26:51.750 --> 26:52.750
Miss Cuiyu.

26:53.990 --> 26:56.330
♪ How many people can understand it? ♪

26:55.880 --> 26:59.290
There are many things in this world

26:57.190 --> 26:59.870
♪ Flowers blossom and wither, again and again ♪

27:00.600 --> 27:03.100
♪ Like meeting once more, only to part again ♪

27:01.190 --> 27:02.650
that happen for no reason.

27:03.770 --> 27:05.350
♪ Time has already changed ♪

27:06.320 --> 27:11.150
♪ Yet we promise to wait ♪

27:13.870 --> 27:18.960
♪ Splitting the heart, offering love to the raging flames ♪

27:20.420 --> 27:25.660
♪ Tears become the wind, stirring the world into daylight ♪

27:26.660 --> 27:28.130
♪ Don't look back, keep walking ♪

27:28.910 --> 27:30.070
♪ Live or die, keep moving forward ♪

27:30.730 --> 27:32.310
♪ Through the fire ♪

27:33.460 --> 27:36.170
♪ Whose love ♪

27:36.220 --> 27:37.500
You cherish me

27:37.340 --> 27:39.570
♪ Could be wider than the universe? ♪

27:37.880 --> 27:39.710
more than you cherish yourself.

27:40.280 --> 27:42.860
♪ It's ours ♪

27:40.860 --> 27:42.010
Yitan,

27:43.170 --> 27:44.940
is that how much you care for me?

27:57.190 --> 27:58.220
You're going out?

27:58.840 --> 27:59.510
Yes.

28:00.220 --> 28:01.310
For what?

28:03.500 --> 28:04.630
To meet someone.

28:06.050 --> 28:07.110
Who are you meeting

28:07.330 --> 28:08.590
at this late hour?

28:10.740 --> 28:12.140
A man.

28:17.210 --> 28:18.200
Do I look good?

28:19.740 --> 28:21.160
Do you like how I look?

28:25.030 --> 28:26.030
What if I do?

28:26.540 --> 28:27.790
What if I don't?

28:29.440 --> 28:31.790
You're quite interesting today.

28:32.640 --> 28:35.720
Too bad I don't have time to play with you.

28:36.540 --> 28:38.340
What exactly are you going to do?

28:38.920 --> 28:41.310
I'm going to find out
if what you said is true.

28:41.310 --> 28:43.040
When Lord Jiuhuo feeds,

28:43.060 --> 28:45.030
his prey always wears red.

28:45.220 --> 28:47.280
Why else would I be dressed like this?

28:48.960 --> 28:49.970
You can't do this.

28:50.030 --> 28:53.130
If I can control Ye Yuan,
I can control Jiuhuo.

28:53.410 --> 28:54.910
I don't like waiting!

28:55.740 --> 28:57.920
Jiuhuo is much more powerful than Ye Yuan.

28:57.920 --> 28:59.970
When Lord Jiuhuo feeds,

29:00.350 --> 29:01.600
he's at his weakest.

29:02.940 --> 29:04.340
Huaizhu, you can't go.

29:04.370 --> 29:05.240
Jiuhuo…

29:07.850 --> 29:08.650
You…

29:09.470 --> 29:11.320
Huaizhu, Jiuhuo is a celestial demon.

29:11.320 --> 29:13.380
Don't do anything foolish! Huaizhu!

30:08.590 --> 30:11.610
Lord Ye Yuan sent me to serve you.

30:12.510 --> 30:13.350
Come closer.

30:16.770 --> 30:18.630
I said, come closer.

30:19.310 --> 30:20.880
Why aren't you moving?

30:21.790 --> 30:22.720
I heard

30:23.750 --> 30:26.220
no woman who has served Lord Jiuhuo

30:26.450 --> 30:28.500
has ever left alive.

30:33.730 --> 30:35.180
Don't worry.

30:35.790 --> 30:37.350
You'll die for me,

30:38.260 --> 30:40.650
and I'll surely remember your face.

30:48.930 --> 30:50.400
Left Guardian.

30:51.090 --> 30:53.590
Lord Jiuhuo,
you're indeed a celestial demon.

30:53.590 --> 30:56.330
You can still fight back
when you're so weak.

30:56.620 --> 30:57.690
However,

30:58.370 --> 31:00.330
your efforts are in vain.

31:10.050 --> 31:11.230
Tell me,

31:12.220 --> 31:14.930
who am I really?

31:15.310 --> 31:18.970
I found you 20 years ago.

31:19.110 --> 31:20.870
You're Dongfang Huaizhu

31:21.070 --> 31:22.680
from the Divine Fire Villa.

31:24.810 --> 31:26.490
So what he said

31:26.890 --> 31:28.240
is true after all.

31:31.010 --> 31:33.160
Why did you bring me here?

31:33.300 --> 31:37.150
Why do I have the Black Fox's demonic aura?

31:37.780 --> 31:40.250
I want you to tell me everything.

31:40.750 --> 31:43.650
You were used by your mother, Jiang Juanxue,

31:44.050 --> 31:46.830
as a vessel for Jia Lan.

31:46.960 --> 31:49.290
After Jia Lan
completely lost her physical body

31:49.290 --> 31:51.260
and turned into the Black Fox,

31:51.440 --> 31:53.750
everything your mother, Jiang Juanxue, did

31:53.750 --> 31:57.070
was to find a new body for Jia Lan.

31:57.240 --> 31:58.720
And that is you,

31:58.770 --> 32:00.870
Dongfang Huaizhu.

32:05.820 --> 32:07.900
Dongfang Huaizhu…

32:09.720 --> 32:14.080
So she's a fool betrayed by her own mother.

32:16.560 --> 32:18.230
When the Boundary breaks,

32:18.400 --> 32:20.350
the Black Fox will possess me.

32:21.310 --> 32:23.200
Your Jia Lan will return,

32:23.270 --> 32:25.040
and I will disappear.

32:31.860 --> 32:33.750
You want Jia Lan.

32:34.040 --> 32:37.110
Wangquan Hongye wants Dongfang Huaizhu.

32:37.540 --> 32:40.190
Since no one has chosen me,

32:40.920 --> 32:42.980
I won't let you off either.

32:43.810 --> 32:46.260
Tell me, what restrains you?

32:46.440 --> 32:48.420
Dragon bone and dragon blood.

32:48.620 --> 32:50.830
The nemesis of the Netherworld Clan

32:51.350 --> 32:53.500
is the Dragon Clan.

33:23.480 --> 33:25.470
I somehow feel

33:25.640 --> 33:29.580
I've forgotten something
at the Rebirth Pool today.

33:37.430 --> 33:39.430
Was Left Guardian

33:39.580 --> 33:41.350
wearing red today?

33:41.510 --> 33:42.200
Yes.

33:42.270 --> 33:45.270
Since returning from Mount Xuankong,

33:45.470 --> 33:47.730
she doesn't like wearing black anymore.

34:09.840 --> 34:10.969
Good morning, Miss.

34:12.400 --> 34:13.320
Mr. Mu.

34:13.880 --> 34:15.210
What are you doing here?

34:17.159 --> 34:20.120
[999 Cold Medicine]

34:18.429 --> 34:20.350
Mr. Mu, I'm leaving.

34:20.960 --> 34:22.110
I know I'm weak

34:22.190 --> 34:23.630
and can't help you much.

34:23.770 --> 34:25.980
I made this cold medicine myself.

34:26.070 --> 34:27.190
It clears heat, detoxifies toxins,

34:27.190 --> 34:29.190
and helps you ward off cold and wind.

34:29.440 --> 34:30.560
Keep it with you

34:30.630 --> 34:32.210
in case you ever need it.

34:32.460 --> 34:33.719
The world is vast.

34:33.840 --> 34:35.500
Please take care of yourself.

34:37.150 --> 34:38.770
I don't know your pain, so I shouldn't

34:38.770 --> 34:40.100
have told you to be kind.

34:41.230 --> 34:42.780
I overstepped yesterday.

34:42.989 --> 34:43.670
I'm sorry.

34:47.320 --> 34:48.030
And…

34:51.980 --> 34:53.179
This is for you.

35:04.160 --> 35:06.440
I couldn't sleep last night,

35:06.730 --> 35:08.270
so early this morning,

35:08.440 --> 35:10.840
I went to pick flowers and made another one.

35:11.590 --> 35:12.360
Thank you.

35:16.360 --> 35:17.320
Well then…

35:20.600 --> 35:21.690
Take care, Miss.

35:40.320 --> 35:41.600
You coward.

35:41.620 --> 35:43.220
What's there to be afraid of?

35:43.470 --> 35:44.670
If you have a grudge,

35:44.710 --> 35:45.940
just settle it.

35:46.150 --> 35:47.000
Besides,

35:47.410 --> 35:49.090
can you bear to leave Dummy?

35:49.360 --> 35:50.930
Stop it.

35:51.150 --> 35:53.960
He's kind to you because he's a good person.

35:55.470 --> 35:57.730
There's no way he would ever love a demon.

35:58.160 --> 36:00.090
How would you know if you don't try?

36:05.470 --> 36:06.550
Dummy,

36:06.880 --> 36:08.070
you guys want to enter my mind, right?

36:08.070 --> 36:09.140
No problem.

36:29.440 --> 36:30.240
Good morning.

36:31.400 --> 36:33.960
Shouldn't we exchange some information?

36:38.040 --> 36:39.000
You first.

36:42.360 --> 36:43.910
Jiuhuo told me

36:44.030 --> 36:46.260
I really am Dongfang Huaizhu.

36:47.150 --> 36:52.470
I really am the vessel he prepared for Jia Lan.

36:54.750 --> 36:56.880
There's nothing I know that you don't.

36:58.500 --> 37:00.190
But I can contact Yang Yitan.

37:00.440 --> 37:02.200
If we want to break the deadlock,

37:02.200 --> 37:03.400
we need outside help.

37:03.980 --> 37:05.970
Jiuhuo controls everything.

37:06.330 --> 37:07.970
You can't leave Sky City.

37:09.290 --> 37:10.500
But you can.
